    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcd4a37c01dbc88a4ac1060a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半速度略微上升\\n但有时会很累",
      "source_fingerprint": "a507d79c0dcff61ee16ce1494d642660fa3a654fe034ec622fd94a5d1b6ec3ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60b829494ec30547e44c011",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘若位于前方的话\\n提高速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c337057c011cff00a28cc87d619bcf7fd06c6284d5cf3e14bf94f3977aa3ce24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e1bcb2121929e8b02027e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘若位于前方的话\\n略微提高速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c6f67baf1ca53fe211afd5b830f4f7ce7600f5857b3c02c7c47c612109a7be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a683172e0008512aa61e9c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比通常的领放战术更大幅度地\\n拉开与后方的距离,并且\\n一直到最后都甩开对手＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e105f91e35d1368fa0f68b5cbebe9caa907a1ad4654f2141434bfd11feb9851",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe8629b6355bc72b5b92a54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "背负期待的强烈感情转变为力量\\n最终弯道处提升速度\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24339c3e9b15239501b5132f0c6302be81862ba8800df3592c3cca802ee185a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c7ae4192254be9098aea91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚进入比赛中盘时若位于队伍中间\\n会略微减慢速度\\n并回复大量持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd0ee61139274f8397b634ccc55517bf60a9970efa44dcc1ad82fda669beff8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2a6b854ac9958cc66ed217",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚进入比赛中盘时若位于队伍中间\\n会略微减慢速度\\n稍微回复持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "de5f3c4918315460d21029948fe6753b642cf707f564afb730c970f8b3efc8f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c9bc967906556152ee8451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于中团后方\\n加速力提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1289f8a4237e7d882b55af7adf7ca21be3d1d4a581f1e3d41d7b7b79f8b0f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0741a9202af55ffc222a3bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于中团后方\\n加速力稍微提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d324e807a78273b035aa9165f97d69b0869d62400f995e8120ceeb2e3afb3932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869bbf9bb56680411a06a26a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n小幅恢复持久力\\n并提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "dec7b9e7f743e15556bac0bb6d91fbb06d1e5d321885c9daafa03cc2495fdd63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28143830c55863dc077ce963",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n微幅恢复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c2dbc5e4c14941a0e5f921b304ce76cb03e415c102b132b4d806bdc20e5db6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fffb63faf58138cf4418250",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "85a1ac58a055420d86ee26de8eab4fcc7e18657480070573faa1d1e8c1256161",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f86615684d250533ce4ee57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ddd9cc5e44e4d130fa32674bdc1f870a08d0ec8d75dea5766b52bccd1eea3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c021ff690e39e40138428ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于后方位置的话\\n则会提高速度＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cbbbad60b55d540d9a233c3197672643052ee515ec1d595f78474ce9ee671b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1180892ae1725941da88ec18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于后方位置的话\\n则会略微提高速度＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "455fd8cf21821136297440fb7f73c4237313a671cabb2a5ee382b623abc1506d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e68e487c580358a8fc6b27b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半程处于中间集团的话\\n会提高速度,并且加速度也会稍微提高\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01463dfe554183d3be2c0969f70f361de381ff7e6e1e9d6c2078bf2ddb16c06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1fc63a8233606c69d11def3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半程处于中间集团的话\\n会略微提高速度,并且加速度\\n也会略微提高＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec37439f60fb4c3d0ae7141e1c8cd3fe7ca38276cdb71909ff4b6062d7008a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1af80e33bdcecfe0bf20341",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n稍微降低后方马娘的速度\\n自身速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "757901ec80d4e9b6976dcd54196b7ecaa77c826dcb522b76eef6d260267e22ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a711ea9caf82e0cb1302ddf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n略微降低后方马娘的速度\\n自身速度稍微提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ba96212c1e864f6ea57435ce7ede8255da7944a7f411fd3278b6cc8c4bf534",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2586ac9ccbab9b99ccd86f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起步晚的时间变长\\n并且智力稍微下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd59b4bdc170efc2cb3649ee760521d79b8a8f6c37e84730c98ef1e57ccd348",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a06c41196ae30ea075b738c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘小幅消耗耐力\\n大幅提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf9452c84c42f12ffdfc3f4f54080d8c072e9002feb38769ca4f14baeee7ef7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9467fefc55b1282ca4d6a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘小幅消耗耐力\\n小幅提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d7ad60fb7677f4dcb964df9e03adf9ebc4a36f9b8af046ec9fe27269da1678",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934aeb372605738a764c0995",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "智力上升,稍微不容易变得焦躁",
      "source_fingerprint": "0371e797fef6d1d10004860e5b0446716e1c600cb25feaf18f5acd7b27d3453e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264e3720292b3a85b067d362",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下坡提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "39290ac21199f08da2bd1a00438fc9d39d8faecf47e204a938f3bf3b0d26d5e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b5c598ff360865ebcb0531",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下坡略微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8990613aa01c94765caba04899ac00b402d10fa7225462f228a7f50bd76e461",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fc87bf2c199b908765539f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被强大赛马娘们的气势所压倒\\n根性和智力稍微下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "08068922a60a54c8ad8f10361c06db36f915ba53c4d866ae14f9d44658831fe0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd9dc97e7afe5b92d171ad8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有起跑晚的话\\n就会在中盘一开始时回复大量体力\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8b74cf4e01488f8de2b976142250f65988e640a951bd1c72a8e1cfe13773e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05c9993c8a4eae6d1b1b2e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有起跑晚的话\\n就会在中盘一开始时回复少量体力\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5d1b5996c1c12397ea80dc3744cc76af71b007b7cb133827263a5059ccb1fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
